    <string name="help_main">The map starts covered by fog. Tap the red record button to start exploring: the fog clears around the places you walk, also with the screen off. Tap stop when you finish.\n\nThe map icon downloads satellite maps to use without a connection, and the route icon lists your tracks, where you can import routes you already walked (GPX files) and delete tracks.\n\nThe chip at the top shows the squares you have revealed and the offline maps you have.\n\nThe button above the toolbar centers the map on you and follows you; tap it again to turn the map with the compass. Long-press it to pick a mode.</string>
