    <string name="help_download_title">Download maps</string>
    <string name="help_download">Circle the area to download with one finger; use two fingers to move and zoom the map. You can draw several areas: undo removes the last one and the bin removes them all.\n\nThe chip at the top counts the tiles to download; it turns red above the limit. The zoom button sets how much detail to download: each extra level multiplies the tiles by about four.\n\nAreas you already downloaded are outlined in blue. Downloading needs a connection and goes on in the background if you leave this screen.</string>
